abstract: >-
  TapeLM (variant A) couples a frozen dual-channel character-curve encoder with
  zero-training fingerprint modules—lexicon calibration, episodic slots, subject writes,
  and hop/bind composition—in the same normalized fp-space as next-token generation.
  The artifact documents matched-GPT parity, honest fair GPT+RAG comparisons, capability
  wins on noisy/OOV text and slot unlearn, and explicit falsifications (generative
  fingerprints, hybrid rerankers, internalization attempts Stages 210–212). Not a
  monolithic SOTA language-model claim; an alternative memory contract with a staged
  evidence trail.
